1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:43,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There must be a mole among us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

2
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know who it is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

3
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What the…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

4
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>PREVIOUSLY</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

5
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:51,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is Police Captain Chansuek,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a skilled undercover agent we sent to work</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

6
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:54,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>as one of Kamnan Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in Mae Hong Son some time ago.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

7
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I really can't remember</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

8
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who I am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

9
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch. I'm so confused.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

10
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:02,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll give you a name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

11
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:05,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll call you Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

12
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

13
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My name is…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

14
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is the Pink Star diamond,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

15
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>worth 300 million, that was stolen.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

16
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These are the faces</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of two of the four suspects.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

17
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:31,480
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Daddy, Mommy, help me!</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

18
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:13,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

19
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

20
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm no thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

21
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't lie to me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

22
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I woke up the moment you moved.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

23
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,839
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You searched through all my bags.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

24
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Were you faking it just to hug me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

25
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't change the subject.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

26
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You creep!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

27
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What happened this time?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

28
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:39,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho, she's a thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

29
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She followed us here to rob us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

30
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:44,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, Luang Pho. He misunderstood.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

31
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:47,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could I misunderstand?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She searched every bag.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

32
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She would've taken all the money</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>if there had been any.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

33
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Noona? What do you say?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

34
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

35
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was hungry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

36
00:04:58,160 --> 00:05:02,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I haven't eaten anything</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>since this morning. I couldn't sleep.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

37
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:07,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My stomach kept growling,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so I woke up to find something to eat.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

38
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Really?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

39
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Of course.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

40
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:16,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hungry? Then why go through my pocket?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

41
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:22,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, I thought I might find a snack, gum,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or even a piece of candy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

42
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't buy it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

43
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't buy it, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

44
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:28,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let it go, Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

45
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:31,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Noona has already explained herself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

46
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Besides,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

47
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:36,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we have to spend tonight together anyway.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

48
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And more importantly,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

49
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:41,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we don't have anything valuable</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to worry about, do we?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

50
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

51
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:51,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's fruit in my alms bag.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

52
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:53,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Help yourself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

53
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Gosh.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

54
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

55
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She can't be trusted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

56
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,720
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>So this fool really doesn't have</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>the diamond?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

57
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,600
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Then where is it?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

58
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:30,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Am I going to die of dengue</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or malaria out here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

59
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And no sunscreen either. I'm so dead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

60
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:36,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sure, I'll buy you some.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

61
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's probably a mall right up ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

62
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:59,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Watch your step, Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's a branch.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

63
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

64
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:26,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you hugging me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can walk on my own.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

65
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I shouldn't have saved her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

66
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

67
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why is a monk with him?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

68
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:11,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho, please let me rest for a bit.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

69
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I can't go on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

70
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

71
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

72
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is wrong with you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

73
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:23,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Another break? It's almost dark.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

74
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

75
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

76
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:32,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My leg hurts.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

77
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

78
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:35,559
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we're just walking through the forest,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and your leg already hurts?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

79
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

80
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:39,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

81
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Help!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

82
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey, stop! Stop for a second!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You! Help me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

83
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:51,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Sit down first. Easy, easy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

84
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

85
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Wait, hold still.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I don't know what it is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

86
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

87
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A leech!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

88
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A leech?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

89
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:07,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Take it away!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey, don't move! Stay still!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

90
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:08,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

91
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't pull it off.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You shouldn't pull it off.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

92
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:15,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It will leave a wound,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and you'll bleed a lot.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

93
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:17,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh no.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

94
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Get it off me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Stay still.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

95
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait a second.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

96
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

97
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Here, take this, Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Ouch.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

98
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hurry up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

99
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is it off yet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

100
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Has it come off yet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

101
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's off now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

102
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right, Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

103
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:53,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get some water to clean the wound. Hurry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

104
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

105
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:58,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll be right back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

106
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where the hell is the water?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

107
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:18,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho didn't even tell me</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>where the water is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

108
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

109
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

110
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Give me the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

111
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hurry!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

112
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Please, sir!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

113
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please don't kill me, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

114
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:39,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

115
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Not Chan. Do you know who I am?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

116
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't play dumb with me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

117
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hand over the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

118
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What diamond, sir?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

119
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng's diamond!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

120
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

121
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:53,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng who, sir?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why would I have his diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

122
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You snatched it when the car crashed.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

123
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The car crashed?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

124
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:00,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When did that happen?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

125
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hurry up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Please, bro.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

126
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:06,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey! Sir, please calm down!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Get up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

127
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please don't hurt me, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't have it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

128
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I really don't have it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

129
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Your life,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

130
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or the diamond. Choose.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

131
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

132
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll go check on him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

133
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Be careful.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

134
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

135
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's the other diamond thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

136
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Huh? What the hell was that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

137
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

138
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho, hurry! Run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

139
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on, Luang Pho! Run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

140
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did that gunshot come from?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

141
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:01,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Some lunatic started shooting at me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

142
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:04,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? What about Noona?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

143
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

144
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, you! Hurry, run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

145
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

146
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hurry, run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

147
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello, ma'am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

148
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:22,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ms. Yok is coming to stay</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at our Mae Hong Son branch for a week.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

149
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is her VIP room ready?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

150
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's ready, ma'am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

151
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get a car ready for me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

152
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:34,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm going out in 20 minutes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

153
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Certainly, Ms. Yok.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

154
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Excuse me, Ms. Yok.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

155
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:47,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Saranya from Mae Khaning News,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the local paper. May I interview you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

156
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:51,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is her private time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ms. Yok may not be available.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

157
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is the interview about?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

158
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:58,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I would like to ask you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>about the missing diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

159
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm looking into the diamond robbery.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

160
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:04,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What do you mean by asking me that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

161
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:08,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want answers. I want to know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

162
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:11,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>why the diamond was stolen so easily.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

163
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:14,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It seems the robbers already knew</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

164
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the diamond was being transferred</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the bank.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

165
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're going too far.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

166
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't be rude.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

167
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I understand your doubts.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

168
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I have doubts too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

169
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:35,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Even though I was confident</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in our security,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

170
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:39,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the robbers still managed</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to break in and take it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

171
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:44,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You should probably ask the authorities.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

172
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:48,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please help me ask them, as a reporter.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

173
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If this can happen,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

174
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:55,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>can ordinary people still feel safe?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

175
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please excuse me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I have other business to attend to.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

176
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That diamond was insured for 300 million?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

177
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes. I investigated it myself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

178
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why haven't we seen this in the news?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

179
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

180
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:34,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I checked with several news outlets,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and none of them knew about it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

181
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:36,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There was only news</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>about the diamond going missing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

182
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That is strange.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

183
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:42,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Keep this a secret for now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

184
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Understood.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

185
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why would the police cover this up?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

186
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Or could…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

187
00:15:56,880 --> 00:16:00,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the missing diamond be connected</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the insurance money?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

188
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This woman is quite clever.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

189
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:10,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you let another reporter reach me,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

190
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:12,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you're fired.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

191
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:22,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, why was that guy shooting at you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

192
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:25,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's insane.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He thinks I stole his diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

193
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:27,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So did you really take it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

194
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I didn't take it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

195
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Forget diamonds,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

196
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:33,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't even have a single coin.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm still eating Luang Pho's food.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

197
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:35,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You know, as a monk's disciple,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>lying is a sin.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

198
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:37,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not lying. You don't believe me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

199
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:41,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Search me, then. I'll strip right here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

200
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Stop! Just stop!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Do you want to see?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

201
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't believe me, right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

202
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you insane?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

203
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll strip right here. Come search me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

204
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,839
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's a village up ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

205
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Once we cross the wild sunflower field,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

206
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll reach it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

207
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes! Let's stay there tonight.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

208
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:24,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No more mosquito bites. Please, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

209
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:28,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then this place must have a phone</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or a car to take me back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

210
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:30,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Great.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then I can finally get away from her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

211
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>As if I wanted to be stuck with you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

212
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:35,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, wait!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

213
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:39,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So we're just walking in like this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

214
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:41,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Why?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

215
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:45,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we walk in, the villagers will ask</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

216
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who we are, where we came from,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and what we're doing here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

217
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do we have the answers?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

218
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can't we say we were on a tour,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>got lost in the forest,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

219
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and came to ask for help?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

220
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you nuts?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

221
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What kind of tour</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>would come to the border?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

222
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:02,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Especially since we're with a woman.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>People will misunderstand Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

223
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:06,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then just say I'm Luang Pho's daughter.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

224
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:10,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is getting ridiculous.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

225
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:13,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What monk would bring kids</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>on a forest pilgrimage? Use your head.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

226
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:15,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on, it's simple.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

227
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:19,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll go in first,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then you and Luang Pho follow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

228
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:21,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No one will know we came together.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

229
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:25,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is that really a good idea?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

230
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:30,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

231
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:35,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, she sure ditched us</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the moment she got the chance.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

232
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

233
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:44,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you set up shop here,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you'll be the first seller in the village.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

234
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:47,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes. You'll make a fortune.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

235
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Really?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

236
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Of course.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

237
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:55,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I need to find a phone and call town.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

238
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:57,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can't spend another night in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

239
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go easy on that stuff.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

240
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:01,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BAN HUP PHA</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

241
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:05,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, what are you doing?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

242
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who the hell are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

243
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:10,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're not from my village.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

244
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:13,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm a tourist. I got lost in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

245
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:16,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I need to use a phone. Do you have one?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

246
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:18,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How would there be a phone in the forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

247
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you a police informant?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

248
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you see anything earlier?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

249
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What would I have seen? I just got here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

250
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:26,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Take care of her.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

251
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:39,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

252
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:42,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Drop it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

253
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I said drop it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

254
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:49,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You think you're so tough, huh?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

255
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, did you…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

256
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you see that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

257
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:04,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did I do that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

258
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I saw it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-That was awesome.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

259
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-How was that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Stop bragging. Let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

260
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

261
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who the hell are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

262
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you sticking your nose into this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

263
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:19,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, she's my wife.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

264
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:22,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I'm not your wife!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Just play along.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

265
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Help!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

266
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:28,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My wife and I are being robbed! Help!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

267
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Help!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

268
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:34,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You lot again?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

269
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're giving my village a bad name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

270
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:38,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get lost!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

271
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:45,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's going on?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

272
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:46,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who's that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

273
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:57,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The nearest temple is about</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>20 kilometers from here, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

274
00:20:57,520 --> 00:20:59,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's not far.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

275
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>See? Told you it would work.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

276
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:08,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Since when did I become your wife?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could you tell them that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

277
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:11,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I had to say that.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

278
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:14,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A woman with a monk</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and another man would look improper.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

279
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:17,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's none of their business.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

280
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:19,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's not like</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm asking anyone to feed me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

281
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:22,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not worried about you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm worried about Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

282
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

283
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:29,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You may not say things nicely,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but you make sense.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

284
00:21:30,840 --> 00:21:33,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>See? But…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

285
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:36,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>More importantly, you should be honored</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

286
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:39,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that a cool guy like me</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>lets you play my wife.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

287
00:21:41,360 --> 00:21:43,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Gosh.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

288
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:46,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

289
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:48,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What are you doing?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Village Head…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

290
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:51,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is there a long-distance phone</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>around here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

291
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We don't even have electricity</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or running water here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

292
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:55,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

293
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:57,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is there any vehicle</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that can take us to town?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

294
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:02,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The whole village has only one motorbike.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

295
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:07,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Can you ride it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

296
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:09,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where's the motorbike?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

297
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:11,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It was pawned in town.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

298
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

299
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

300
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:20,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we shouldn't trouble him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

301
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:24,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think we should walk instead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

302
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:26,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We should get there in half a day.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

303
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:31,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You can stay here for the night.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

304
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:34,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll arrange a place for you to sleep.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

305
00:22:34,840 --> 00:22:37,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Would that be all right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I feel bad about troubling you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

306
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's all right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

307
00:22:39,280 --> 00:22:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-We'll consider it a chance to earn merit.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-That's right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

308
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:45,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

309
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:49,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's stay here. I agree with him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

310
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:50,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

311
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, then…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

312
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:55,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>may I change clothes too?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

313
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:57,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm starting to smell a little strange.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

314
00:22:57,520 --> 00:22:59,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have any clothes I could borrow?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

315
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:02,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sure. You can use my daughter's clothes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

316
00:23:02,360 --> 00:23:06,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho can sleep in that room.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

317
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:08,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These two can sleep together</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in the main room.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

318
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:10,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

319
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll sleep with him?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

320
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:13,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

321
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't husband and wife sleep together?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

322
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:19,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's nothing, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

323
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:22,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My wife is just being shy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

324
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:27,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

325
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's okay, honey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

326
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:33,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We'll sleep separately from Luang Pho</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so he can have some privacy</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

327
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:35,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and meditate. It's fine, right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

328
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:39,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sure.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

329
00:23:39,600 --> 00:23:43,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you need anything,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>please call me anytime.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

330
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:49,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thank you again.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm sorry for the trouble.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

331
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:51,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's no trouble, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

332
00:23:59,520 --> 00:24:01,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let go already.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

333
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:06,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

334
00:24:07,120 --> 00:24:08,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

335
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:12,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just now, you said Noona and you were…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

336
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:13,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We were just pretending.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

337
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:16,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We only pretended to be married</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so no one would ask questions.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

338
00:24:17,040 --> 00:24:18,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's not improper.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

339
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is that really all right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

340
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:22,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Of course.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

341
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:26,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't worry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If I lie, the sin is mine, not yours.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

342
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Trust me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

343
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:28,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

344
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:31,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's enough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

345
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:37,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey. I'll let you have your way this time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just once.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

346
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:41,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No matter what,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I am not sleeping next to you tonight.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

347
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:43,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Really? Suit yourself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

348
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:46,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Whatever.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

349
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:51,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This guy can't be trusted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

350
00:24:52,120 --> 00:24:53,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He acts crazy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

351
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Welcome, Ms. Yok.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

352
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:08,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Keep a close watch.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

353
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:10,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, ma'am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

354
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You came rather quickly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

355
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello, Ms. Yok.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

356
00:25:21,600 --> 00:25:24,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Beautiful as always. Please have a seat.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

357
00:25:31,280 --> 00:25:33,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Any progress on the diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

358
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:36,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you found those two yet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

359
00:25:36,360 --> 00:25:38,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Calm down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

360
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:43,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I heard they're hiding in that forest,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and I've been chasing them all day.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

361
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:48,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could you let them take my diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

362
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:51,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I told you to keep it safe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

363
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:57,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I did keep it safe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I even put it in the safe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

364
00:25:57,680 --> 00:26:02,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But the two who stole it</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>weren't working for me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

365
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:06,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think they were sent to infiltrate us</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and steal the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

366
00:26:06,760 --> 00:26:07,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Nonsense.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

367
00:26:08,880 --> 00:26:10,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who would send them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

368
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:13,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The person who knew</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

369
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:15,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I stole the diamond from Paul.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

370
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who else would know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

371
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:22,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The only people who knew Paul</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>was going to steal my diamond…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

372
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>were me…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

373
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

374
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:56,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Paul!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

375
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

376
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

377
00:28:11,320 --> 00:28:13,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's Lek, Kamnan Sawaeng's man.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

378
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Damn it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

379
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wayu!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

380
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:49,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Paul, let's go! Run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

381
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:58,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Paul, go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

382
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:11,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

383
00:29:12,800 --> 00:29:13,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

384
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:14,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's on your mind?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

385
00:29:17,560 --> 00:29:18,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm wondering</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

386
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:22,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>how Kamnan Sawaeng knew</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we were robbing Ms. Yok's house,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

387
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:24,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and stole the diamond from us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

388
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:26,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

389
00:29:27,120 --> 00:29:29,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They swooped in and took</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what we worked so hard for.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

390
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:31,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They let us steal the diamond first,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

391
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:33,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then moved in and took it from us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

392
00:29:33,960 --> 00:29:36,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What I can't figure out is</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

393
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:42,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>how they knew the day, the route,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and the timing of our robbery.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

394
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:45,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

395
00:29:49,080 --> 00:29:51,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Or do we have a mole among us?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

396
00:29:53,560 --> 00:29:55,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you reached Sakon?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

397
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Not yet, boss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

398
00:29:58,040 --> 00:30:01,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where the hell is the diamond now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Does he have it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

399
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wayu.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

400
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:06,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tell your men to hurry and find him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

401
00:30:06,120 --> 00:30:07,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, boss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

402
00:30:46,560 --> 00:30:47,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

403
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:52,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's a long walk to bathe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Want to go together?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

404
00:30:52,600 --> 00:30:54,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where's the bathroom?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

405
00:30:58,760 --> 00:30:59,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What the…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

406
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:02,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This guy is so annoying.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

407
00:31:03,040 --> 00:31:04,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait up!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

408
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where are they going?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

409
00:31:09,040 --> 00:31:10,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tofu!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

410
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:13,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

411
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:24,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, don't you dare turn around.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

412
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:27,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

413
00:31:27,280 --> 00:31:28,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who would waste time looking at you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

414
00:31:28,760 --> 00:31:30,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm going to bathe too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

415
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Watch out for leeches!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

416
00:31:33,880 --> 00:31:36,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, you jerk!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

417
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:44,360
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>He doesn't look like a professional thief.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>More like a total weirdo.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

418
00:31:46,240 --> 00:31:48,960
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>You can't tell who's a thief</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>by looks alone.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

419
00:31:49,040 --> 00:31:52,000
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Even police officers</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>can turn out to be thieves.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

420
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:56,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, how did you end up meeting Luang Pho?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

421
00:31:57,080 --> 00:31:58,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know either.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

422
00:31:59,120 --> 00:32:01,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can't remember anything</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>before I met Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

423
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My head hit something.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

424
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:06,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

425
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:09,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's still a wound.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

426
00:32:10,440 --> 00:32:12,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't remember anything at all?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

427
00:32:12,280 --> 00:32:17,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you remember nothing, how can you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>still speak like a normal person?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

428
00:32:17,560 --> 00:32:19,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

429
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:22,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then all old people with dementia</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>would be speaking some divine language.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

430
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:25,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You ask such weird questions.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

431
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:29,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you interrogating me anyway?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

432
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:31,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What does my past have to do with you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

433
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:34,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well… I just want to know you better.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

434
00:32:34,760 --> 00:32:37,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We're traveling together.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is it wrong to ask?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

435
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:40,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No need. We'll part ways tomorrow anyway.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

436
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:46,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

437
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you bathing now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

438
00:32:48,320 --> 00:32:50,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get inside,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or the gut-eating ghost will get you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

439
00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:53,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-A gut-eating ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

440
00:32:55,040 --> 00:32:56,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's a gut-eating ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

441
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:59,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I heard it's kind of like a ghoul,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

442
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:02,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>one that likes eating raw flesh.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

443
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:06,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right… I'm out of here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

444
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait for me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

445
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Oh no.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Wait!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

446
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:11,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm going ahead. See you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

447
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:26,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well? Is this far enough?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

448
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:28,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

449
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

450
00:33:51,040 --> 00:33:52,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

451
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:55,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just came to tell you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

452
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:57,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that before you sleep,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

453
00:33:57,480 --> 00:34:00,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you should spend some time</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>meditating and chanting.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

454
00:34:00,320 --> 00:34:03,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Spend just five or ten minutes a day</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

455
00:34:03,320 --> 00:34:07,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>purifying your mind.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

456
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:09,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It may help restore your memory.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

457
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You too, Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

458
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:15,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When sleeping in an unfamiliar place,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

459
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:19,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>ask permission</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from the local spirits first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

460
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:22,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

461
00:34:23,080 --> 00:34:23,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

462
00:34:31,199 --> 00:34:34,639
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just lay down less than a minute ago.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

463
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

464
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:00,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Where are you going?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

465
00:35:00,200 --> 00:35:01,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where are you going?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

466
00:35:01,240 --> 00:35:04,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm sleeping with Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Isn't this what you wanted?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

467
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:05,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You can sleep here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

468
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:10,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No. It's too open here. I'm cold.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

469
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:13,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why bother Luang Pho?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

470
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's a sin.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

471
00:35:16,560 --> 00:35:18,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're not afraid of me anymore?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

472
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was never afraid of you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

473
00:35:21,360 --> 00:35:22,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just didn't trust you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

474
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

475
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No! Don't!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

476
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:47,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You idiot!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

477
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

478
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:53,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why did you kiss me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

479
00:35:53,160 --> 00:35:55,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You did that! What are you doing?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

480
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:59,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you realize</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you just stole my first kiss?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

481
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:00,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You did the same to me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

482
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:05,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You? A virgin? Gross.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

483
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:06,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Yuck.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Bragger.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

484
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:16,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

485
00:36:21,600 --> 00:36:22,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

486
00:36:22,840 --> 00:36:24,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

487
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:25,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

488
00:36:25,520 --> 00:36:27,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What is it with you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

489
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:28,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

490
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:31,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, calm down. What's going on?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

491
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:33,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho, look at that!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-There! Over there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

492
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:36,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What is it with you two?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-It's here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

493
00:36:37,600 --> 00:36:38,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Where?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

494
00:36:38,720 --> 00:36:40,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please drive the ghost away!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

495
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:42,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I'm out of here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

496
00:36:43,520 --> 00:36:44,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

497
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

498
00:36:56,680 --> 00:36:58,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan is truly blessed.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

499
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:02,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A venerable monk came here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in person to name her baby.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

500
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:04,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's true, Village Head.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

501
00:37:05,520 --> 00:37:09,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My wife, Chan, is due any day now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She can barely walk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

502
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:13,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho, would you please name the baby?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

503
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:14,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about Boonmee?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

504
00:37:25,200 --> 00:37:29,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>To be born</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

505
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:32,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in a remote wilderness like this</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

506
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>means this child is truly blessed.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

507
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:38,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I shall name this child…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

508
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:40,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thangtham.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

509
00:37:41,040 --> 00:37:43,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's a wonderful name, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

510
00:37:43,160 --> 00:37:45,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

511
00:37:45,680 --> 00:37:46,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That name sounds so cool.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

512
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:50,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then why did you name me Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

513
00:37:50,680 --> 00:37:51,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And didn't you survive?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

514
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:53,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I did.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

515
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:58,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When are you two</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>going to have a baby like them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

516
00:38:06,120 --> 00:38:09,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, we're working on it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

517
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:11,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Keep trying hard, then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

518
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We're trying.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

519
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:13,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Keep trying.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

520
00:38:19,160 --> 00:38:20,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

521
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:23,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you seen these two pass through here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

522
00:38:27,520 --> 00:38:31,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, this guy looks like that couple</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from yesterday.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

523
00:38:31,840 --> 00:38:33,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

524
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:35,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did you see them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

525
00:38:44,440 --> 00:38:45,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did they see Chansuek?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

526
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:52,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Maybe he's trying to find a buyer</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>for the diamond in Ban Hup Pha.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

527
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Find him. Now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

528
00:39:19,520 --> 00:39:22,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I got new information on Chansuek</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

529
00:39:37,520 --> 00:39:38,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

530
00:39:39,040 --> 00:39:40,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You two.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

531
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:43,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please take this food</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the old lady near the village.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

532
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What old woman?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

533
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:50,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't ask.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

534
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:53,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just do as I told you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

535
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:55,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The old woman near the village.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

536
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

537
00:40:12,120 --> 00:40:13,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, Village Head.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

538
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:22,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

539
00:40:23,080 --> 00:40:25,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Since you're already here,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

540
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:27,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>may we invite you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

541
00:40:28,240 --> 00:40:30,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to perform a ritual</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to drive away a gut-eating ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

542
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:33,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please accept our invitation.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

543
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:37,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A gut-eating ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

544
00:40:53,640 --> 00:40:55,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Greetings, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

545
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Blessings to you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

546
00:40:58,240 --> 00:41:01,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>For the past two months,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

547
00:41:01,400 --> 00:41:05,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>our livestock has been disappearing</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>almost every day.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

548
00:41:05,160 --> 00:41:07,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>At first, we thought a tiger took them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

549
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:11,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then one day, the villagers saw</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a gut-eating ghost with their own eyes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

550
00:41:11,520 --> 00:41:13,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It comes out hunting at night.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

551
00:41:13,600 --> 00:41:16,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We couldn't catch it,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

552
00:41:16,520 --> 00:41:21,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so we called a shaman</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from another village to help find it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

553
00:41:22,200 --> 00:41:23,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you all doing?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

554
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:32,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's starting, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

555
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:42,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Everyone, follow him! Hurry!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

556
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:47,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, Village Head. Follow them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

557
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:55,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Step on it, Sergeant.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

558
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:57,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>find Chansuek first and kill him,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

559
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll get nothing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

560
00:42:06,600 --> 00:42:07,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

561
00:42:09,600 --> 00:42:11,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think we're being followed.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

562
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:14,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Could it be Sawaeng's men?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

563
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:40,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Their car has stopped, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

564
00:42:41,560 --> 00:42:42,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

565
00:42:53,160 --> 00:42:55,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think their car broke down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's smoke everywhere.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

566
00:42:55,560 --> 00:42:57,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, Sergeant. Pull over.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

567
00:42:58,600 --> 00:43:00,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

568
00:43:00,120 --> 00:43:01,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why pull over?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

569
00:43:01,480 --> 00:43:03,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're going to help them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

570
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:04,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Back the car up.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

571
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:08,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't think it's them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

572
00:43:11,080 --> 00:43:11,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

573
00:43:52,560 --> 00:43:53,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Were you stalking me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

574
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:55,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stalking you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

575
00:43:55,480 --> 00:43:58,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm just here for a trip and some coffee.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

576
00:43:58,960 --> 00:44:03,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, fate really brought people together.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

577
00:44:04,720 --> 00:44:05,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who's that, Sergeant?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

578
00:44:06,560 --> 00:44:08,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The Captain's ex-girlfriend.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Her name is Ya.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

579
00:44:08,880 --> 00:44:13,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She's a reporter.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But how did those two happen to meet here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

580
00:44:17,480 --> 00:44:18,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello, Ms. Ya.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

581
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:20,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hello, Sergeant Lerm.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

582
00:44:22,400 --> 00:44:26,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You followed me here for news, didn't you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know how you are.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

583
00:44:29,960 --> 00:44:32,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll call a mechanic for you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I have to go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

584
00:44:33,480 --> 00:44:34,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

585
00:44:35,720 --> 00:44:38,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't even know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>when the mechanic will come.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

586
00:44:41,240 --> 00:44:42,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So what do you want?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

587
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:45,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Since we're here, I'll just go with you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

588
00:44:45,640 --> 00:44:46,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

589
00:44:47,040 --> 00:44:48,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm working.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

590
00:44:48,880 --> 00:44:50,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm after the same thing you are.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

591
00:44:50,200 --> 00:44:54,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm looking for Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who stole the diamond too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

592
00:44:57,520 --> 00:44:58,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How do you know about this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

593
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:02,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know even more than that.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then it's settled.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

594
00:45:02,240 --> 00:45:03,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No. This is a secret mission.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

595
00:45:04,840 --> 00:45:07,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't think it's a secret anymore, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

596
00:45:07,680 --> 00:45:08,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

597
00:45:08,600 --> 00:45:10,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's no secret now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

598
00:45:10,200 --> 00:45:13,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But if you let me tag along,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

599
00:45:13,120 --> 00:45:15,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I promise I'll keep quiet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

600
00:45:15,400 --> 00:45:17,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-But if you don't…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

601
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:19,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you threatening us?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

602
00:45:19,280 --> 00:45:20,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I haven't said anything yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

603
00:45:20,560 --> 00:45:22,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was just going to say,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

604
00:45:22,240 --> 00:45:24,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>if you won't let me come with you…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

605
00:45:25,440 --> 00:45:26,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that's fine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

606
00:45:29,400 --> 00:45:30,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then you can come with us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

607
00:45:32,520 --> 00:45:33,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

608
00:45:34,840 --> 00:45:36,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you sure about this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

609
00:45:36,720 --> 00:45:38,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She already knows what we do.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

610
00:45:38,720 --> 00:45:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If she comes with us, she can be a witness</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>if Superintendent Cheewin tries anything.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

611
00:45:54,040 --> 00:45:55,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

612
00:45:56,000 --> 00:45:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho asked us to bring you food.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

613
00:45:58,800 --> 00:46:01,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How does Luang Pho know her?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't get it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

614
00:46:03,040 --> 00:46:05,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Maybe he met her</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>while on his forest pilgrimage.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

615
00:46:06,160 --> 00:46:07,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

616
00:46:07,080 --> 00:46:10,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You go check that way. I'll go this way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

617
00:46:17,600 --> 00:46:19,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you smiling at?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

618
00:46:19,960 --> 00:46:22,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was thinking about last night.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

619
00:46:23,080 --> 00:46:24,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No! Don't!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

620
00:46:35,360 --> 00:46:36,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You jerk!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

621
00:46:37,680 --> 00:46:39,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

622
00:46:39,120 --> 00:46:40,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You need to go that way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

623
00:46:43,280 --> 00:46:44,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Feeling shy?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

624
00:46:57,160 --> 00:46:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

625
00:47:00,680 --> 00:47:01,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

626
00:47:02,840 --> 00:47:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

627
00:47:05,880 --> 00:47:06,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

628
00:47:08,480 --> 00:47:10,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny, where are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

629
00:47:11,920 --> 00:47:12,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

630
00:47:15,600 --> 00:47:16,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

631
00:47:18,560 --> 00:47:19,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny, where are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

632
00:47:22,840 --> 00:47:24,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

633
00:47:27,280 --> 00:47:28,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

634
00:47:32,680 --> 00:47:33,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Granny?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

635
00:47:33,880 --> 00:47:35,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

636
00:47:38,960 --> 00:47:41,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Both of you are here, you bastards.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

637
00:47:42,640 --> 00:47:44,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan. Sakon.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

638
00:47:44,600 --> 00:47:46,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You bastards betrayed my father.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

639
00:47:46,640 --> 00:47:47,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NEXT EPISODE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

640
00:47:49,760 --> 00:47:51,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, what the…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

641
00:47:51,440 --> 00:47:52,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

642
00:47:52,600 --> 00:47:55,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop pretending. You're the diamond thief.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

643
00:48:00,640 --> 00:48:03,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho and I found him in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

644
00:48:03,360 --> 00:48:07,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He doesn't remember who he is,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so we brought him here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

645
00:48:17,600 --> 00:48:18,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go. Get in the car.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

646
00:48:20,560 --> 00:48:21,960
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Luang Pho, run!</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

647
00:48:22,480 --> 00:48:23,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

648
00:48:25,440 --> 00:48:28,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you still won't talk,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll cut out your tongue.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

649
00:51:35,800 --> 00:51:40,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Subtitle translation by: Akekaphong C.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
